WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:09.814
"Help!" cried Peter.

2
00:00:09.815 --> 00:00:14.814
"I’m stuck in this net!"

3
00:00:14.815 --> 00:00:20.072
Some birds flew over to Peter.

4
00:00:20.073 --> 00:00:24.045
They tried to help him.

5
00:00:24.046 --> 00:00:28.077
"Don't give up!" called one bird.

6
00:00:28.078 --> 00:00:36.076
"Keep trying to get free!"

7
00:00:36.077 --> 00:00:40.241
"Take off your jacket!" shouted another.

8
00:00:40.242 --> 00:00:42.870
Peter stopped crying.

9
00:00:42.871 --> 00:00:46.656
Quickly Peter slipped out of his jacket.

10
00:00:46.657 --> 00:00:53.386
Now he was free!

11
00:00:53.387 --> 00:00:57.146
But the farmer was still chasing him.

12
00:00:57.147 --> 00:01:00.214
Peter ran away fast.

13
00:01:00.215 --> 00:01:07.819
"Get back here!" cried the farmer.

14
00:01:07.820 --> 00:01:12.783
Peter dashed into a shed.

15
00:01:12.784 --> 00:01:17.547
It was filled with garden tools.

16
00:01:17.548 --> 00:01:21.205
Peter leaped into a watering can.

17
00:01:21.206 --> 00:01:26.390
Splash! The can was filled with icy water.

18
00:01:26.391 --> 00:01:30.405
"Brr!" said Peter.

19
00:01:30.406 --> 00:01:33.859
The farmer rushed into the shed.

20
00:01:33.860 --> 00:01:38.808
"Where is that rabbit?" said the farmer.

21
00:01:38.809 --> 00:01:40.986
Peter shivered.

22
00:01:40.987 --> 00:01:44.821
He heard the farmer moving things around.

23
00:01:44.822 --> 00:01:49.712
The man was looking for Peter.

24
00:01:49.713 --> 00:01:53.959
"Where are you, rabbit?" muttered the farmer.

25
00:01:53.960 --> 00:01:58.060
The farmer's footsteps were close now.

26
00:01:58.061 --> 00:02:01.304
"Uh-oh," whispered Peter.

27
00:02:01.305 --> 00:02:04.418
He felt a tickle in his nose.

28
00:02:04.419 --> 00:02:06.943
The tickle grew worse.

29
00:02:06.944 --> 00:02:10.886
"Ah-choo!" Peter sneezed.

30
00:02:10.887 --> 00:02:18.532
"Aha!" cried the farmer.

